<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Sept car registrations fall prov 9.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss Sept car registrations fall prov 9.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations of new cars in Switzerland and Liechtenstein fell a provisional 9.4 percent in September to 15,809 from 17,450 a year earlier, the Swiss Automobile Importers Association (VSAI) said.</p>
<p>Definitive figures for August showed registrations dropped to 15,910 from 17,084.</p>
<p>In the first nine months of 1996, registrations were off 1.4 percent to 212,027 from 215,070.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
